    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43249" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτέρ-ωθι</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on the other side</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθεν . . , ἑ. δὲ . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.235
				</span></i>
			: in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.301
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.69a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλοθι</span>
			, <i>elsewhere</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.351
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.348
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.531
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prm.</u>
				146c
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδαμόθι ἑ</span>.
			nowhere <i>else</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.113
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. πανταχοῦ</span> anywhere
				<i>else</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				6.39
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγει ἑ. ὅτι</span>
			<i>in another passage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.372
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.58
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. τοῦ λόγου</span>
			<i>in another part</i> of my story, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. που τοῦ σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					663b3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>at another time</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τότε μὲν . . , ἑ.
				δὲ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.35
			</span></i>.</div>
